@startuml
title Figure 17: Completion of the resource order item related to the Voice Mail RFS

participant "Resource Inventory" as RI #blue
participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue
participant "Resource Activation\n& Configuration" as RAC #blue
participant "Resource Catalog\nManagement" as RCM #blue
participant "VMS"

== Step 3 (Voice mail) ==

ROM -> RCM : 1 **TMF634 Resource Catalog Management**\nGET /resourceSpecification
RCM --> ROM : 2 **TMF634** 200 OK (VMS profile specification)

ROM -> RI : 3 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nGET /resource
RI --> ROM : 4 **TMF639** 200 OK (HSS subscriber profile, Number)

ROM -> RI : 5 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPOST /resource\n(VMS profile, resourceStatus="standby")
RI --> ROM : 6 **TMF639** 202 Accepted (VMS profile, monitorRef)

ROM -> RAC : 7 **TMF702 Resource Activation Management**\nPOST /resource (VMS profile)
activate RAC
RAC --> ROM : 8 **TMF702** 201 OK (VMS profile)

RAC -> RCM : 9 **TMF634 Resource Catalog Management**\nGET /resourceSpecification (VMS API)
RCM --> RAC : 10 **TMF634** 200 OK (VMS API specification)

ROM -> RI : 11 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nGET /resource
RI --> ROM : 12 **TMF639** 200 OK (API endpoint)

RAC -> VMS : 13 **VMS API** (VMS profile)
activate VMS
VMS --> RAC : 14 **VMS API** (response)
deactivate VMS

ROM -> RAC : 15 **TMF702 Resource Activation Management**\nGET /monitor (monitorRef)
RAC --> ROM : 16 **TMF702** 200 OK (monitorState="Completed")
deactivate RAC

ROM -> RI : 17 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource\n(VMS profile, resourceStatus="available")
RI --> ROM : 18 **TMF639** 200 OK

ROM -> RI : 19 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nPATCH /resource\n(HSS subscriber profile, Number)
RI --> ROM : 20 **TMF639** 200 OK

ROM -> ROM : 21 update resourceOrderItem (state="completed")

@enduml
